<h4 id="quotezonecouk-is-one-of-the-uks-leading-car-insurance-comparison-websites-helping-millions-of-drivers-throughout-the-uk-find-cheaper-car-insurance-each-year">Quotezone.co.uk is one of the UK’s leading car insurance comparison websites, helping millions of drivers throughout the UK find&nbsp;<a href="https://www.quotezone.co.uk/car-insurance">cheaper car insurance</a>&nbsp;each year.</h4>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-css-opacity is-style-wide">



<p>So whether you’re a&nbsp;<a href="https://www.quotezone.co.uk/car-insurance/young-drivers">younger driver</a>&nbsp;or merely young-at-heart, a&nbsp;<a href="https://www.quotezone.co.uk/car-insurance/learner-drivers">learner driver</a>, a&nbsp;<a href="https://www.quotezone.co.uk/car-insurance/student">student driver</a>&nbsp;or a motoring veteran, if you’ve recently bought a new car (or your existing car insurance policy is due for renewal but the quote you’ve been offered brings a tear to your eye) our short online form will enable you to compare car insurance quotes from hundreds of different insurance companies and car insurance brokers in a matter of minutes.</p>



<p>And we can help with more than just car insurance, you’ll be pleased to know. In fact, our clever insurance comparison technologies can help you find truly great deals on more than 70 different insurance and financial services products, from&nbsp;<a href="https://www.quotezone.co.uk/van-insurance">van insurance</a>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<a href="https://www.quotezone.co.uk/motorbike-insurance">motorbike insurance</a>,&nbsp;<a href="https://www.quotezone.co.uk/home-insurance">home insurance</a>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<a href="https://www.quotezone.co.uk/travel-insurance">travel insurance</a>,&nbsp;<a href="https://www.quotezone.co.uk/professional-indemnity-insurance">professional indemnity</a>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<a href="https://www.quotezone.co.uk/public-liability-insurance">public liability</a>.</p>



<h5 id="is-quotezonecouk-free-to-use">Is Quotezone.co.uk free to use?</h5>



<p>Yes, whether you’re comparing car insurance prices, home insurance quotes, pet insurance policies or any of the other financial services products we compare, you’ll never pay a penny to use our service.</p>



<p>That doesn’t mean the insurance quotes you receive will be higher, though. Quite the opposite, in fact: in many cases you’ll be able to find a cheaper insurance quote by using Quotezone.co.uk than you would if you got quotes from each provider directly.</p>



<h5 id="how-does-quotezonecouk-make-money">How does Quotezone.co.uk make money?</h5>



<p>Quotezone.co.uk is an insurance comparison website, which means we help you to compare insurance quotes from hundreds of providers and then receive a referral fee from your provider if you decide to sign up for a new policy via our site.</p>



<p>That fee is not built into the cost of your policy, though – it truly is the insurers paying for the referrals, not their policyholders.</p>



<p>In fact, many people will find that they’ll get a cheaper quote for their car insurance, home insurance, travel insurance or pet insurance when they use Quotezone.co.uk than they would have been offered if they’d gone to the provider directly.</p>



<h5 id="does-quotezonecouk-only-compare-car-insurance-quotes">Does Quotezone.co.uk only compare car insurance quotes?</h5>



<p>Quotezone.co.uk was an early pioneer of car insurance comparison technologies – we’ve been helping drivers compare car insurance quotes since 2005, and we’re still one of the UK’s leading sites for comparing car insurance policies. But the same price comparison technologies that allow you to compare quotes from hundreds of car insurance providers now enable you compare other types of insurance products, too – in fact, we now compare quotes for&nbsp;<a href="https://www.quotezone.co.uk/insurance-sitemap">over 70</a>&nbsp;different insurance and financial services products.</p>



<h5 id="will-i-find-a-better-insurance-quote-if-i-go-direct-to-the-providers">Will I find a better insurance quote if I go direct to the providers?</h5>



<p>Quotezone.co.uk works with hundreds of different insurance companies and you should receive the same quote from each of them whether you get that quote via our website or by going to each one directly.</p>



<p>In addition, you should be able to get quotes from a much wider range of insurance providers when you use our price comparison site, which makes it more likely that you’ll find a cheaper quote.</p>



<p>Most people aren’t likely to get individual quotes directly from a hundred or more insurance firms when they’re ready to take out a policy, but you can do just that (and do it in a matter of minutes) when you use Quotezone.co.uk to compare insurance providers.</p>



<h5 id="how-much-can-i-save-by-comparing-insurance-policies-through-quotezonecouk">How much can I save by comparing insurance policies through Quotezone.co.uk?</h5>



<p>That depends on the type of insurance policies you’re comparing, as well as a wide range of personal and policy-specific variables, but when it comes to car insurance our research suggests that 51% of consumers could save up to £360 by using Quotezone.co.uk to compare car insurance quotes.*</p>



<h5 id="will-i-always-find-a-better-price-than-my-renewal-quote">Will I always find a better price than my renewal quote?</h5>



<p>It’s not a hard-and-fast rule, but many policyholders do find that they’re able to find cheaper quotes from other providers when they do an insurance comparison at the time their existing policy is due for renewal.</p>



<p>It only takes a couple of minutes to compare policies via Quotezone.co.uk, and you’ve nothing to lose by doing a comparison. We’d recommend that policyholders never accept their current insurance provider’s renewal quote until they’ve compared prices from a wide range of other providers…that way they’ll be much more likely to find the best insurance policy for their needs at a truly competitive price. </p>


        </div>
    </div>
</section>        </div>
